d gain even more players forward.\") [ ![Aternos](https://static.spigotmc.org/img/aternos.png) ](https://www.spigotmc.org/go/aternos \"Minecraft servers. Free. Forever.\") [ ![Tebex Donation Plugin & Webstore](https://static.spigotmc.org/img/tebex.png) ](https://www.spigotmc.org/go/tebex \"Struggling to cover the costs of your Minecraft Server? Setup your\nown webstore with Tebex in under 30 seconds.\")\n[Sign up now!](https://www.spigotmc.org/register/)\n### [Wiki Index](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/)\n  * [BungeeCord](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/bungeecord/)\n  * [Forums](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/forums/)\n  * [Spigot](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot/)\n\n\n### Top Editors \n\n[Mineplugins](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/mineplugins.173014/)\n    386 \n\n[smmmadden](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/smmmadden.104514/)\n    375 \n\n[Jeppa](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/jeppa.50435/)\n    373 \n\n[RockinChaos](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/rockinchaos.3051/)\n    343 \n\n[Maximvdw](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/maximvdw.6687/)\n    325 \n\n[Blackixx](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/blackixx.649/)\n    235 \n\n[Indyuce](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/indyuce.253965/)\n    230 \n\n[BrettPlays](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/brettplays.80037/)\n    205 \n\n[Phoenix616](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/phoenix616.3651/)\n    191 \n\n[Zrips](https://www.spigotmc.org/members/zrips.24572/)\n    179\n### Wiki Statistics \n\nPages:\n    1,407 \n\nEdits:\n    13,453 \n\nLikes:\n    0 \n\nViews:\n    39,877,268 \n\nAttached Files:\n    13 (318.6 KB)\n**SpigotMC - High Performance Minecraft Software**\n[Home](https://www.spigotmc.org/) [Wiki](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/) \n\nStyle\n\n  * [FAQ](https://www.spigotmc.org/threads/311785/)\n  * [Contact Us](https://www.spigotmc.org/threads/contact-us.321793/)\n  * [Terms](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-terms/)\n  * [Rules](https://www.spigotmc.org/wiki/spigot-rules/)\n  * [Privacy Policy](https:/